WEBVTT

1
00:58:34.338 --> 00:58:39.338
I want to pronounce a blessing over all the men.

2
00:58:40.338 --> 00:58:43.338
Men, could you all please stand up. All the men in the room.

3
00:58:48.338 --> 00:58:53.338
I'm not saying Father's Day, because not all men are fathers.

4
00:58:54.338 --> 00:58:57.338
It would be woke to say that we should include all men then.

5
00:58:57.338 --> 00:59:00.338
A father is a father and a man is a man.

6
00:59:01.338 --> 00:59:05.338
Last week I was in Scotland.

7
00:59:06.338 --> 00:59:13.338
I was there to attend a wedding and to bless a part of it.

8
00:59:13.338 --> 00:59:17.338
Of one of the boys who has been coming to the church here for a while.

9
00:59:17.338 --> 00:59:19.338
Unfortunately, that season is coming to an end.

10
00:59:19.338 --> 00:59:22.338
Contracts begin and contracts end.

11
00:59:23.338 --> 00:59:30.338
When you go to another country as a Christian, you quickly pick up what's going on there.

12
00:59:31.338 --> 00:59:35.338
And actually, you also quickly become a bit blurry and a bit blind to the things happening in your own country due to the habits of your own land.

13
00:59:35.338 --> 00:59:41.338
That's why you often have missionaries from certain parts of the world going to another part of the world...

14
00:59:41.338 --> 00:59:46.338
and they quickly pick up, wow, this is happening here or wow, that is happening there.

15
00:59:46.338 --> 00:59:50.338
In the past few days that I was in Scotland, particularly in Glasgow, I quickly picked up...

16
00:59:50.338 --> 00:59:56.338
that I often saw witchcraft shops.

17
00:59:56.338 --> 00:59:59.338
I saw that young men were drunk from four o'clock in the afternoon.

18
00:59:59.338 --> 01:00:03.338
It was ridiculous to see.

19
01:00:03.338 --> 01:00:06.338
People walking, young ladies were not walking out, they didn't look good.

20
01:00:07.338 --> 01:00:11.338


21
01:00:11.338 --> 01:00:16.338
No father would wish for his daughter to look like that.

22
01:00:16.338 --> 01:00:19.338
And sometimes even in the early evening hours.

23
01:00:19.338 --> 01:00:24.338
And you pick up that there is a dark side to a certain city.

24
01:00:24.338 --> 01:00:30.338
When I was talking about it with Vanessa, we asked each other the question, where is the church?

25
01:00:30.338 --> 01:00:35.338
Because that is not going to change just like that.

26
01:00:35.338 --> 01:00:44.338
And so what Vanessa just said, through the Holy Spirit, is that the change in the Netherlands and Belgium...

27
01:00:44.338 --> 01:00:47.338
is not in politics.

28
01:00:47.338 --> 01:00:53.338
The change in the Netherlands and Belgium is not in presidents and rich men.

29
01:00:53.338 --> 01:00:59.338
The change in the Netherlands and Belgium is not in anything at all, not even that.

30
01:00:59.338 --> 01:01:03.338
And that is why I wanted to ask the men to stand up.

31
01:01:03.338 --> 01:01:10.338
It is not even in the change of culture and fads that ebb and flow.

32
01:01:10.338 --> 01:01:12.338
Pay close attention to what I say.

33
01:01:12.338 --> 01:01:20.338
I was talking with Laura's pastor, who has a church in the north of Scotland.

34
01:01:20.338 --> 01:01:22.338
And I had a good conversation with him.

35
01:01:22.338 --> 01:01:31.338
And without mentioning numbers, his church seems very similar to the growth we are also experiencing in our church.

36
01:01:31.338 --> 01:01:35.338
And Glory Hallelujah, his church is also growing.

37
01:01:35.338 --> 01:01:43.338
A small village, started with dozens of people and now it looks like it has a few hundred people inside.

38
01:01:43.338 --> 01:01:47.338
And the number itself does not matter, it is about the growth here.

39
01:01:47.338 --> 01:01:53.338
And what you heard last week when I gave that break about evangelism...

40
01:01:53.338 --> 01:01:58.338
and I showed that video of the leader of Youth With A Mission from YWAM...

41
01:01:58.338 --> 01:02:09.338
The statements, the bullet points he mentioned, were also regularly that he saw the growth of interest from young men especially increasing.

42
01:02:09.338 --> 01:02:12.338
Many men come to repentance.

43
01:02:12.338 --> 01:02:22.338
But in our conversation, and I felt that our conversation was truly led by God, we came together to the following conclusion.

44
01:02:22.338 --> 01:02:30.338
But, the growth or interest of young men coming to the church, we all here in the church...

45
01:02:30.338 --> 01:02:38.338
must not come from just a headwind, just a headwind from this society as it looks.

46
01:02:38.338 --> 01:02:44.338
It should not be that the world is going completely crazy...

47
01:02:44.338 --> 01:02:50.338
and that a large group of men will eventually say, yes but wait a minute, this makes no sense.

48
01:02:50.338 --> 01:02:52.338
So I'm going to look for it somewhere else.

49
01:02:52.338 --> 01:03:00.338
Because here is the point, if it is only a wind from society, then it is of short duration.

50
01:03:00.338 --> 01:03:06.338
Then you only have young men eventually saying, yes listen, I really have no interest in this nonsense.

51
01:03:06.338 --> 01:03:11.338
I really have no interest in this gay nonsense, I really have no interest in these stupid things that are being said here.

52
01:03:11.338 --> 01:03:19.338
And what we were discussing together, this pastor and I, is that ultimately the church should not be filled...

53
01:03:19.338 --> 01:03:25.338
with a bunch of bullies, who will eventually say bad world, stupid this, stupid that, stupid that.

54
01:03:25.338 --> 01:03:33.338
And that those men will position themselves in something that is only a counter shout of something we do not like in society.

55
01:03:33.338 --> 01:03:36.338
Do you understand where I am going?

56
01:03:36.338 --> 01:03:46.338
Your repentance in Jesus is based on a man who died on a cross for your sin.

57
01:03:46.338 --> 01:03:52.338
For your sin, not for the absurdity of this society.

58
01:03:52.338 --> 01:03:54.338
For your sin he died.

59
01:03:54.338 --> 01:03:59.338
Because when we come to repentance, we hold a mirror to ourselves.

60
01:03:59.338 --> 01:04:02.338
We do not come to repentance because they are so stupid.

61
01:04:02.338 --> 01:04:07.338
We come to repentance because we were so foolish. Amen?

62
01:04:07.338 --> 01:04:09.338
And here is my point.

63
01:04:09.338 --> 01:04:12.338
Dear men in this room, I find it wonderful to see.

64
01:04:12.338 --> 01:04:15.338
This has been a prayer of mine personally.

65
01:04:15.338 --> 01:04:18.338
And I have often prayed in the past ten years.

66
01:04:18.338 --> 01:04:21.338
Lord, add men to the church.

67
01:04:21.338 --> 01:04:25.338
And when we hear that from the leader of Youth With A Mission.

68
01:04:25.338 --> 01:04:29.338
That he says, many men worldwide are coming to repentance.

69
01:04:29.338 --> 01:04:31.338
Then I can only say, praise God.

70
01:04:31.338 --> 01:04:35.338
But what I want to see is that the faith that is sown in you.

71
01:04:35.338 --> 01:04:39.338
That it is not seed that falls on the rocks or on the path.

72
01:04:39.338 --> 01:04:41.338
So that it will ultimately be very short-lived.

73
01:04:41.338 --> 01:04:44.338
Because you know, if it is just a shout of defiance.

74
01:04:44.338 --> 01:04:47.338
Then your seed is just like the seed that falls on the path.

75
01:04:47.338 --> 01:04:49.338
Very short on the rocks.

76
01:04:49.338 --> 01:04:51.338
Very briefly it will take root.

77
01:04:51.338 --> 01:04:53.338
For a moment we are enthusiastic.

78
01:04:53.338 --> 01:04:56.338
And then, without the Holy Spirit, we fall into boredom.

79
01:04:56.338 --> 01:04:58.338
We fall back into our own sin.

80
01:04:58.338 --> 01:05:00.338
And ultimately, just forget it.

81
01:05:00.338 --> 01:05:03.338
And then it has only been a short duration.

82
01:05:03.338 --> 01:05:06.338
What we must do, dear men in this church.

83
01:05:06.338 --> 01:05:10.338
Is we must be grounded in Jesus Christ.

84
01:05:10.338 --> 01:05:13.338
Your seed must be seed that falls in good soil.

85
01:05:13.338 --> 01:05:15.338
What does that mean?

86
01:05:15.338 --> 01:05:19.338
Good seed always falls in cultivated soil.

87
01:05:19.338 --> 01:05:21.338
It is always neatly tamped down.

88
01:05:21.338 --> 01:05:23.338
It is always given water.

89
01:05:23.338 --> 01:05:26.338
There is always growth. There is always patience.

90
01:05:26.338 --> 01:05:29.338
There is always a process. There is always pruning.

91
01:05:29.338 --> 01:05:33.338
So that ultimately your life can bear fruit.

92
01:05:33.338 --> 01:05:36.338
I want to emphasize to us, especially men.

93
01:05:36.338 --> 01:05:39.338
Women, you have been faithful in the congregation for many years.

94
01:05:39.338 --> 01:05:42.338
Women have always had the upper hand for those decades.

95
01:05:42.338 --> 01:05:46.338
Women may have had the upper hand for hundreds of years.

96
01:05:46.338 --> 01:05:50.338
Because women have given themselves more readily on that emotional level.

97
01:05:50.338 --> 01:05:52.338
In a kind of humbling towards God.

98
01:05:52.338 --> 01:05:55.338
And for us men, it is always, I decide that myself.

99
01:05:55.338 --> 01:05:58.338
But now it is up to us to give ourselves to God.

100
01:05:58.338 --> 01:06:00.338
Not a counter shout.

101
01:06:00.338 --> 01:06:04.338
For that is just the fighter mentality that is in us men.

102
01:06:04.338 --> 01:06:08.338
But now we must learn to die to our own selves.

103
01:06:08.338 --> 01:06:10.338
Would all the men please close their eyes?

104
01:06:10.338 --> 01:06:13.338
I want to pray for all of us.

105
01:06:13.338 --> 01:06:19.338
Father in heaven, I want to ask you to bless us men.

106
01:06:19.338 --> 01:06:23.338
Show us who Jesus truly is.

107
01:06:23.338 --> 01:06:27.338
Help us to open our hearts to the Holy Spirit.

108
01:06:27.338 --> 01:06:29.338
Remove autonomy from us.

109
01:06:29.338 --> 01:06:32.338
That we will not say, I will decide this myself.

110
01:06:32.338 --> 01:06:35.338
But that we will give our lives to the King.

111
01:06:35.338 --> 01:06:37.338
So that we will live for Him.

112
01:06:37.338 --> 01:06:41.338
And that we may go through life as kings and priests.

113
01:06:41.338 --> 01:06:44.338
As leaders just as Jesus was a leader.

114
01:06:44.338 --> 01:06:50.338
And that through us, the Netherlands and Belgium and all the countries represented in this room.

115
01:06:50.338 --> 01:06:52.338
May those countries change.

116
01:06:52.338 --> 01:06:56.338
Through the great awakening and a revival we just sang about.

117
01:06:56.338 --> 01:06:59.338
That the revival in the men will be a birthing.

118
01:06:59.338 --> 01:07:02.338
That will never stop, that will not be short-lived.

119
01:07:02.338 --> 01:07:08.338
But that the seed sown in us will be watered, pruned, and bear fruit.

120
01:07:08.338 --> 01:07:11.338
In the right season in the name of Jesus.

121
01:07:11.338 --> 01:07:14.338
I bless us all under the blood of Jesus.

122
01:07:14.338 --> 01:07:20.338
That the faith which has been sown in us will be protected by the blood of Jesus.

123
01:07:20.338 --> 01:07:25.338
And that it may not be snatched away by Satan.

124
01:07:25.338 --> 01:07:27.338
In Jesus' mighty name.

125
01:07:27.338 --> 01:07:29.338
And all the men say amen.

126
01:07:29.338 --> 01:07:30.338
Amen and amen.

127
01:07:30.338 --> 01:07:31.338
Praise God.

128
